    affiliation: "Holonym Foundation / Hebbian Loop"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hebbianloop/glimmer"
url: "https://glimmer.science"
abstract: >-
  Glimmer (glimmer-rokb) is a research-object knowledge base schema, validator,
  live graph query and BM25 retrieval CLI, provenance drift detector, executable
  run-record verifier, and cross-agent scientific skill built over typed
  YAML-frontmatter Markdown sidecars.
